<?php if (!luxureat_cms_detail('zh-recipe-sweet-bread-butter-caviar', 'zh', 'recipe')): ?><main class="lux-article-page"><nav class="lux-breadcrumb" aria-label="面包屑导航"><a href="<?php echo esc_url(luxureat_static_url('zh', '')); ?>">首页</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><a href="<?php echo esc_url(luxureat_static_url('zh/recipe', '')); ?>">食谱艺术</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><span aria-current="page">甜面包配黄油和鱼子酱</span></nav><article class="lux-recipe-reader lux-recipe-seo-page"><section class="lux-recipe-hero"><figure><img width="600" height="400" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" src="<?php echo esc_url(get_template_directory_uri() . '/assets/media/journal/recipe-sweet-bread-butter-caviar.webp'); ?>" alt="甜面包配黄油和鱼子酱"></figure><div class="lux-recipe-intro"><span>甜点食谱</span><h1 id="lux-reader-title">甜面包配黄油和鱼子酱</h1><p>甜面包配黄油和鱼子酱是一种优雅的小食，柔软香甜的奶油蛋卷面包、醇厚的黄油与鱼子酱的鲜美风味完美融合。</p><dl class="lux-recipe-facts"><div><dt>时间</dt><dd>10分钟</dd></div><div><dt>难度</dt><dd>简单</dd></div><div><dt>份量</dt><dd>4人份</dd></div></dl></div></section><section class="lux-recipe-body"><aside class="lux-recipe-ingredients"><h2>食材</h2><ul><li>4块甜面包，例如奶油蛋卷面包</li><li>40克优质黄油（最好是无盐黄油）</li><li>20克鱼子酱（例如鲟鱼子酱或Beluga鱼子酱）</li><li>少许糖粉（可选，用于装饰）</li></ul></aside><div class="lux-recipe-method"><h2>准备</h2><ol><li>将奶油蛋卷面包切成4块立方体或厚片，保持面包柔软。</li><li>将黄油在室温下软化，然后均匀涂抹在面包上。</li><li>将鱼子酱轻轻放在每块涂了黄油的面包上。</li><li>置于优雅的盘子上。如果想增强对比度，可以轻轻撒上糖粉。</li></ol></div></section><section class="lux-recipe-nutrition"><header><h2>每份的估计营养成分</h2></header><dl><div><dt>能量</dt><dd>720千焦（约170千卡）</dd></div><div><dt>饱和脂肪</dt><dd>5克（25%）</dd></div><div><dt>碳水化合物（糖类）</dt><dd>10克</dd></div><div><dt>蛋白质</dt><dd>5克</dd></div></dl><figure class="lux-recipe-video"><video controls playsinline preload="none" poster="<?php echo esc_url(get_template_directory_uri() . '/assets/media/journal/recipe-sweet-bread-butter-caviar.webp'); ?>" aria-label="甜面包配黄油和鱼子酱"><source src="<?php echo esc_url(get_template_directory_uri() . '/assets/media/recipes/sweet-bread-butter-caviar.mp4'); ?>" type="video/mp4"></video><figcaption>鱼子酱点亮精致的一口，启发奶油鱼子酱吐司的摆盘美学。</figcaption></figure><div class="lux-recipe-extra-videos"><video style="flex-grow: 0.5625; aspect-ratio: 0.5625" data-lux-autoplay muted loop playsinline preload="none" controls aria-label="甜面包配黄油和鱼子酱 1"><source data-src="<?php echo esc_url(get_template_directory_uri() . '/assets/media/recipes/extra-caviar-service.mp4'); ?>" type="video/mp4"></video><video style="flex-grow: 0.5625; aspect-ratio: 0.5625" data-lux-autoplay muted loop playsinline preload="none" controls aria-label="甜面包配黄油和鱼子酱 2"><source data-src="<?php echo esc_url(get_template_directory_uri() . '/assets/media/recipes/extra-caviar-detail.mp4'); ?>" type="video/mp4"></video><video style="flex-grow: 1.773399; aspect-ratio: 1.773399" data-lux-autoplay muted loop playsinline preload="none" controls aria-label="甜面包配黄油和鱼子酱 3"><source data-src="<?php echo esc_url(get_template_directory_uri() . '/assets/media/recipes/truffle-summer-crostini.mp4'); ?>" type="video/mp4"></video></div></section><section class="lux-recipe-details"><div><dt>参考产区</dt><dd>参考：威尼斯风味甜咸小食</dd></div><div><dt>推荐用油</dt><dd>此食谱以无额外用油为主，可用少量温和橄榄油收尾</dd></div><div><dt>过敏原提示</dt><dd>含麸质、奶、鱼类；面包与鱼子酱标签需确认</dd></div><div><dt>可替换食材</dt><dd>奶油蛋卷可换小片法棍；黄油可用无乳涂抹酱但需确认鱼子酱搭配</dd></div><div><dt>相关产品</dt><dd><a class="lux-recipe-product-link" href="<?php echo esc_url(luxureat_static_url('zh/product', '?category=caviar#product-catalogue')); ?>">鱼子酱产品目录（以实际库存和标签为准）</a></dd></div></section></article></main><?php endif; ?>
